entityDescription:
Created in September 2011, LEXFO is an independent firm providing audits and technical expertise in information system security. 
With a &euro;17M turnover in 2023, LEXFO currently counts with 100employees, among which 80driven security engineers distributed in security teams that specialize in Cyber Threat Intelligence(CTI), security incident response(ANSSI-qualified trusted service provider), homologation(ANSSI-qualified evaluation center), security audits, training and awareness raising, etc.

LEXFO performs over 2,000 security audit and incident response projects a year for more than 250 clients and currently offers a wide range of preventive and reactive services, supported by tools and technologies that are generated by our transverse R&D activity as well as by a team with multiple skills and areas of expertise.

Our differentiating assets include:
- A technical expertise recognized by ANSSI (PRIS qualification, ITSEF and PVID agreements) and IEC/IECEE (IEC-17025 certification);
- An offensive approach, using methods similar to those used by attackers;
- Adaptability and flexibility in responding to our clients&rsquo; needs and context;
- Senior experts with complementary profiles in different areas of expertise;
- A transverse R&D activity that translates into the development of innovative tools for supporting our various services;
- Strong values of independence, integrity, thoroughness, availability and reactivity;
- A culture of confidentiality and strict protection of our clients&rsquo; information;
- Presence all over France (Paris, Lyon, Toulouse, La Roche-sur-Yon, Grand-Ouest) and intervention capacities at the European and international level

